 before deciding whether to gather; leave the established southern stock available to Lin.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"sol-current-root-source-survey\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Which known meadow-root sources currently hold food, and which are empty seedlings?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"At tick 247 forest-root-1 at (21.2,21.3) visibly holds 11 roots.\\\",\\\"The tick-247 physical observation of plant-238-world-1389 reports stock 0 and stage seedling.\\\",\\\"Personal dated observation records start-1-roots at (20.1,14) with stock 5 at tick 233.\\\",\\\"Lin reports at tick 247 that they are approaching forest-root-1 for a meal, with reported satiety 14.6 and energy 19.1.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Northern root stock may have changed since tick 233. Seedling growth and future yield have not been established.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain a current second-source observation and communicate confirmed availability without assuming regeneration.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Distinguished the visible stocked mature source from the nearby empty seedling.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Dated stock and stage observations for two nearby root plants.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Current observation of start-1-roots.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Recover energy, travel to the known northern source, and observe its current state.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Current observations distinguish an available food source from an empty seedling; no additional food production or wellbeing benefit is claimed.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

